  "description": "Installable-app tool surface for Orleans.Lattice.Api.Mcp. Exposes every enabled app's MCP tools on the single Lattice MCP endpoint under a mandatory {slug}_{tool} namespace, gated per tool by whether the caller is a member of a group the install binds to the tool's declared role, unless the shared access gate explicitly denies it. Reuses the Api.Mcp credential bridge, default-deny authorizer, per-session tool collection and fail-closed discovery. Registered with AddAppMcpTools() alongside AddLatticeMcp(...).",
